        "synopsis": {
            "value": "Manager Kim (So Ji-Sub) works at a small savings bank. He seems like an ordinary single father, raising his daughter Min-Ji. He has a secret that he can't reveal, even to his own daughter. His secret is that he is a former spy and he was dispatched on countless special operations. He is on North Korea's most wanted blacklist and his existence in South Korea is like a time bomb that should not be revealed. Hiding his past, he lives like an ordinary citizen, but his beloved daughter Min-Ji goes missing. He struggles to save his daughter, not hesitating to reveal his secret and risking everything.",
